9", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314641_2334058800454382_6810420958056556067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=myg0xQmAsLsQ7kNvwEvlwLg&_nc_oc=AdqdtVPOQRwV4FKruMdHfeMXFI_8FMX8wV0Vw6FTBq1t0q64n5BZYkL31Y7bHbpBtBQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQoPQUiLgIAEcxcNkab0-m9_UjWdhPZPPX_n7efWa7Mgw&oe=6AEC85DB"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203353.png", "id": "1290753326156435", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312236_1290753329489768_4332884711738293422_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I4NNv2dU6C4Q7kNvwGLm4aX&_nc_oc=AdrR_Wj265NlAUGMDL3XmJTFR0ClXpGQ4imyQLlpYRIHtisZVnxEnmu1n0hW2pbyFV4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS9GGKSPyPbwle_ool5yyrHc5ysUiL7CMKcv-NkdXU8PA&oe=6AEC8581"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203201.png", "id": "1926405484733596", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312338_1926405491400262_5342535590335345652_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WyDbjiXQs3AQ7kNvwEG8vOE&_nc_oc=AdobPy4MWXLk023WOZr1KpfPn8PKDW_gjRMRt_XCC85imkUR3xOfPlKLNWFyo67NZRQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQhII-p0kV4LZLqZe8Ik8uhL7PIhAllek3bmYReouCVwA&oe=6AECA99D"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203301.png", "id": "974613512240519", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312470_974613515573852_1573452143751525995_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=auDQOG4fV8oQ7kNvwFgWiuU&_nc_oc=AdoI3c8G1s0OLGN9GPozI_NujKgGPrPoI6mEGQfMELMe1xtIbvsISAbGCVaO53DRv_g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQStB4X5pH_VP46-FEkDt9PZrHXUqw-IsgDhD-ebYJPu9A&oe=6AECAB7F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "fields-artwork-v2-2560x1440.png", "id": "1690141432030718", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311597_1690141435364051_2132099073325899983_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7gZkUvJ83D4Q7kNvwHQ32J9&_nc_oc=Adp30B0epoYOzjZ9LoDzvFJ4V5rMl7BhUz-Wv6gsgd1cn5jANpG-iOADJPiDfemJ51U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQStRpsEu48C47btXYoSD3nJpjtbtQtFnKtSGGKwmuEsxg&oe=6AEC9FEE"}, "display_name": "Fields", "keywords": ["music", "inmersive", "art", "visuals", "meditation"], "long_description": "Fields is not an album you listen to. It is a place you enter.\n\nAn immersive VR experience built around the music of electronic producer Die Stadt, Fields dissolves the boundary between sound and space. Each track becomes an environment: shifting fields of light, generative textures, and slow chromatic movements that respond to the music in real time.\n\nFields is designed for deep listening \u2014 a rare kind of attention that VR makes possible. No narrative, no objectives. Only presence.\nWhat you will find inside:\n\n- A full-length electronic music album experienced as a living, breathing space.\n- Generative visuals that evolve with the music.\n- Designed for extended, contemplative sessions.\n- Optimized for Meta Quest 3.\n\nFields is an album. Fields is a place. Now you can enter both.\n\nStep in.\n{1548057873348580}", "short_description": "Step inside the music of electronic/ambient producer Die Stadt. Sound becomes space. Space becomes music."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE.png", "id": "2273186383217800", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307451_2273186386551133_8686410893456982869_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sElwarpmw-AQ7kNvwHTnlm3&_nc_oc=Adom37Zf8-ZeMLqiBvSPdjmdZDwns1GIoILz_iUKMcfv2Nmfocwqqy63_nILdfLVQP4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQBMDOdbd2LiqxWmlmih0EKuebKFIXR_D4yIDwUW87xxg&oe=6AEC98DF"}, {"file_name": "fields_logotipo_512x512.png", "id": "2080711572861858", "image_type": "APP_IMG_L